{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54522","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云似虎，或若豹行形（京本作「形行」）。\n及似穿连走匹练（首本注：「一作骢」。\n辛本、川本作「绢」）。\n暴师入境却偷营，排（京本作「摆」）阵整兵迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}